============================================================
DEADLINE / DEGRADED BEST-EFFORT REPORT
============================================================

Interpretation:
- ordinary mode: the repaired decision respects the task deadline;
- DEGRADED_BEST_EFFORT: the final decision still exceeds the deadline;
- the degraded label records a bounded-repair outcome, not a proof of global infeasibility;
- CLOUD is never preferred automatically: the retained decision is the one with the lowest predicted lateness among the alternatives evaluated by the repair policy.

